{
    "title": "Going Up Rooftop Parkour Games",
    "description": "Only Going Up Rooftop Parkour Games!\r\nWelcome to Only Going Up, a rooftop parkour game where you can run across rooftops, jump up, climb up, and slide your way to the top.! Here's what you need to know about this thrilling rooftop parkour adventure. At the start of this Only Going Up parkour game, you can claim a daily reward. In this Only Going Up parkour game, you can choose your favorite character from three different options. Then choose your preferred mode from the selection, and dive into the world of the Only Going Up Rooftop parkour games.\r\nWhether you're breaking climbing records or tackling challenging terrains, there's always something exciting ahead. There are two different modes in this Chained Together parkour game: Career Mode and Open World Parkour Mode.\r\n\r\n\r\nCareer mode of rooftop runner parkour games!\r\nCareer Mode is a level-based mode with 10 challenging levels. In Career Mode, In Career Mode, you'll aim to climb as high as possible and collect checkpoints from the environment to complete each level. Each subsequent level in Only Going Up 3D: Parkour Game is more interesting and challenging compared to the previous one.\r\n\r\nOpen World Mode Parkour of going up rooftop parkour game!\r\nIn Open World Mode of parkour, You'll jump across rooftops and explore a vast 3D environment filled with obstacles. The higher you climb, the better your score! This mode challenges you to reach new heights without falling. To set new records and climb higher each time, you'll need to master the controls, including running and jumping. In Open World Parkour mode, you can collect gold from the rooftops and complete various tasks, including gathering checkpoints in this Rooftops Alleys: The Parkour Game.",
